rialized.\n- The under-100-file requirement is currently a topology/source-envelope constraint, not a verified final-result measurement.\n\n## Completed static work\n\n| EvidenceResult                                                                                                                                                           |                                                                                                                                    |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| [100-layer topology v4](/Users/hedde/.codex/worktrees/17cb/evorto-stack-artifacts/materialization-analysis/.final100-four-slice-topology-correction-v4.build)            | Exact static topology retained; still unsealed and `HOLD/NONE`.                                                                    |\n| [PR #123 source partition v5](/Users/hedde/.codex/worktrees/17cb/evorto-stack-artifacts/materialization-analysis/.pr123-source-coverage-partition-v5.build)              | Exact 40-member projection; projected outer `c583df04…`; no physical final or manifest.                                            |\n| [Row 20 A2-v10 evidence](/Users/hedde/.codex/worktrees/17cb/evorto-stack-artifacts/materialization-analysis/.row20-direct-payment-binding-runtime-a2v10-source-v2.build) | Independent static PASS: three paths, `+1740/-706`, churn `2446`; trusted-host index `12f1616d…`.                                  |\n| [Rows 86–88 provider results](/Users/hedde/.codex/worktrees/17cb/evorto-stack-artifacts/materialization-analysis/.rows86-88-provider-results-source-authority-v1.build)  | Independent PASS: 34 files, stream `d19ce64c…`; all bindings, 196 selected hunks, objects, overlaps, and PR #123 joins reproduced. |\n| [Rows 92–99 final documentation](/Users/hedde/.codex/worktrees/17cb/evorto-stack-artifacts/materialization-analysis/.rows92-99-final-docs-source-authority-v1.build)     | Root and independent PASS after correcting the 49-member count; 49 files, 3,399,515 bytes, stream `81597d0d…`.                     |\n| [Six-row readiness ledger](/Users/hedde/.codex/worktrees/17cb/evorto-stack-artifacts/materialization-analysis/.six-serialized-rows-source-readiness-evidence-v1.build)   | Created as data-only `HOLD/NONE`; intentionally unfinished: derivation rows and a second quiescence audit remain pending.          |\n\nThe special pending-adapter sentinel occurs exactly at positions 18, 20, 21, 63, 73, and 80. That does not mean the other rows are materialization-ready: all 100 still lack final-parent/result authority. Row 18 has a known predecessor; the other five are serialized behind missing predecessor results. Row 21 already binds the accepted direct-gate schema—what is missing is its concrete final-parent instantiation and runtime proof.\n\n## PR #124 repair checkpoint\n\n[PR #124 v6](/Users/hedde/.codex/worktrees/17cb/evorto-stack-artifacts/materialization-analysis/.pr124-live-source-authority-v6.build) stopped quiescent but incomplete:\n\n- 238 files, 2,867,548 bytes; stream `87f60ca1…`.\n- Descriptor ownership was substantially repaired.\n- Real `/usr/bin/git` and shell/touch execution was removed from HM17/HM19.\n- Phase-dependent environment handling and publication-receipt comparisons were strengthened.\n\nRemaining work includes:\n\n- Centralize cleanup into non-raising, exactly-once aggregate finalizers.\n- Remove remaining split descriptor ownership.\n- Pass packet-root owners instead of raw descriptors.\n- Repair setup/failure accumulator handling.\n- Update stale HM17/HM19 documentation and compiled literals.\n- Change the sealer from `0644` to `0600`.\n- Resolve launcher/runner/sealer/publisher/bootstrap pins and regenerate projected outer identities.\n- Perform a fresh, independent, from-zero static audit.\n\n## Next steps\n\n1. Finish and independently audit PR #124 v6.\n2. Complete and independently audit the six-row readiness ledger.\n3. Provide the required isolated materialization environment—or explicitly relax the all-capable-writers threat model.\n4. Materialize the stack sequentially, remeasure every layer below 100 files, and run all required local unit, PostgreSQL 17, integration, Browser, documentation, and provider gates.\n5. Use `gh-stack` to create the draft stack and place PRs #123/#124 appropriately while retaining their backup refs.\n\nThe current hard boundary is isolation: the literal writer model cannot be proven under the shared macOS UID. The strict option is a dedicated macOS guest/separate host or dedicated UID with read-only inputs and a fresh sole-writer output area. Effect and security guidance kept the evidence fail-closed; prior test receipts were not treated as proof for an unmaterialized final stack.\n\n\n\nPlease note that local git is clean, up to date but might not be in sync with the remote.","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"You are taking over from a different model, keep in mind that the entire application might have defects and other issues, the product focused text files should be mostly okay. Prepare the PR stack with [$gh-stack](/Users/hedde/.agents/skills/gh-stack/SKILL.md) in a useful and easy to understand way. Make sure to review everything and reach out to me with bigger issues.\n\nHere is the last models final summary\n\nStopped at a clean, quiescent static checkpoint. All agents have stopped; the goal remains active but incomplete.\n\n## Goal\n\nCreate a focused `gh-stack` draft-PR stack replacing PRs #123/#124, with every layer below 100 files, complete local verification, and the original PR heads safely preserved.\n\n## Current state\n\n- Live checkout is clean:\n  - HEAD `a7c4e4aa6aae685e05fa1df6a9ae52d81c18eb66`\n  - tree `912515733724d562e9b1ee40faa5cd807