w      | Platform template question help text can exceed its schema limit and block saving without a field explanation.                                                                                                        | Display the existing description validation message beside the field and keep independent add-on creation available at the question cap.                                                          | Resolved in assembly: the loaded-template regression and all 145 app files / 1,152 tests pass. The description error uses the existing schema message, and reaching the question cap preserves independent add-on creation.                                                                                                                       |\n| F-222 | Medium   | Copied lowercase or padded transfer codes are rejected before the existing normalization step.                                                                                                                        | Validate the normalized canonical code, bound raw input to 512 characters, and retain the existing complete-code format.                                                                          | Resolved in assembly 4dd644: all 11 rendered normalization cases and the full app suite pass. The complete 167-test functional run includes the original successful transfer journey with a lowercase, padded code and unchanged persistence assertions.                                                                                          |\n| F-224 | Medium   | The PostgreSQL tenant-visibility fixture deletes a fixed named role and unconditionally resets shared RLS settings.                                                                                                   | Use uniquely owned role and policy objects within one transaction, reject pre-existing RLS state, and restore the original state through rollback.                                                | Resolved: uniquely owned transa