The previous clean `6b4b263b` checkpoint passed 164 functional tests, 51 documentation tests, 11 Auth0/Google Maps integration tests, nine live ESNcard tests and nine provider-error unit cases, all without retries. [Previous complete runtime receipt](assembly-6b4b-verification-evidence.json). Those results are historical evidence and do not certify the later head.\\n\\nThe fixture cleanup work preserves 1,549 assertions, 95 test titles and 247 screenshot/documentation calls while registering cleanup before writes and making scenario setup transactional. [Preservation evidence](assembly-f212-preservation.json). Route teardown, reporter redaction and shell argument-forwarding repairs retain their focused regression receipts. Earlier failed runs remain available with their source and cause; sensitive diagnostics have owner-only permissions.\\n\\n## Material findings and repairs\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a06cdc-6399-7b30-9fa8-4b87f0cfba0e","create_time":1788571453.517429}}}
